        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">02.</span> Side-by-Side Syntax Translation Matrix
        </h2>
        <p>
          Translating complex enterprise CI pipelines requires understanding the exact semantic mapping between GitHub Actions workflow schemas (<code class="text-cyan-400">.github/workflows/*.yml</code>) and GitLab CI definitions (<code class="text-emerald-400">.gitlab-ci.yml</code>).
        </p>

